A bold identifier: :math:`\mathbf{v}`.

Faces on single tokens:
:math:`\mathit{x}\mathcal{L}\mathfrak{g}\mathbb{R}\mathsf{s}\mathtt{t}`.

Faces on text:
:math:`\textbf{bold words}\textit{\textbf{both}}\textbf{\textit{\textsf{all three}}}`.

A face inherited by a whole row: :math:`\mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b}`.

A face inherited through nested constructs:
:math:`\frac{\mathfrak{p}}{\mathfrak{q}}\sqrt{\mathcal{y}}`.

A token overriding the face it inherits: :math:`\mathbf{a}\mathtt{b}`.

